      "title": "At a glance",
      "body": "For travelers, Cho tôi nhận phòng is the phrase to keep ready for \"I'd like to check in\" in front desk, room, check-in, and hotel-service moments. This is for when you are ready to begin check-in. This is the default phrase when the reservation exists and you need the next step. It works best when you focus on putting the need first and leaving room for the helper to confirm the detail. The forms below help you choose the version that fits the person, setting, or level of politeness.",
